  "goodToKnow": "Das Asylrecht is the right of asylum: Politisch Verfolgte genießen Asylrecht (Article 16a GG), written into the Grundgesetz in response to Nazi persecution. The 1993 Asylkompromiss restricted it, so people arriving via safe third countries can't claim it under that article. Most protection today is granted under the Geneva Refugee Convention and EU law. Der Asylbewerber or Asylsuchende is an asylum seeker. It has no plural."
